---
const cliente = [
  { sigla: "NG", nombre: "Angular", detalle: "TypeScript", color: "var(--color-pop)" },
  { sigla: "FL", nombre: "Flutter", detalle: "Dart · móvil", color: "var(--color-accent)" },
];

const api = ["Clean Architecture", "CQRS", "Web API"];
const datos = ["T-SQL", "Stored procedures", "Modelado"];
const tools = ["Git", "Azure DevOps", "Claude Code", "Azure CI/CD"];
---

<section id="sobre-mi" class="scroll-mt-[10px] py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.35fr] lg:gap-16"
  >
    <!-- Presentación -->
    <header class="rise">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <div class="monograma" aria-hidden="true">ER</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
          Ernye Ruiz Cerdas
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- <p class="mt-6 font-display text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">
        <span class="text-gradient-pop">Desarrollador Full Stack · Cartago, CR</span>
      </p> -->

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Soy un desarrollador apasionado por la programación y la arquitectura de sistemas. 
        Me gusta especialmente trabajar en la lógica del backend aunque tambien disfruto el 
        desarrollo frontend y móvil. Me motiva aprender nuevas tecnologías, 
        afrontar desafíos y colaborar con equipos de desarrollo.
      </p> 
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Cuando no estoy frente a la pantalla, suelo hacer actividad física, compartir tiempo 
        con mis seres queridos y fortalecer mi relacion con Dios.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Diagrama de capas -->
    <div class="rise grid gap-3">
      <div class="fila">
        <p class="etiqueta">Cliente</p>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {
            cliente.map((c) => (
              <div class="tarjeta flex items-center gap-4" style={`--c:${c.color}`}>
                <span class="icono">{c.sigla}</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">{c.nombre}</p>
                  <p class="text-ink-muted">{c.detalle}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fila">
        <span class="hidden sm:block"></span>
        <p class="conector" style="--c:var(--color-accent)">REST</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fila">
        <p class="etiqueta">API</p>
        <div class="tarjeta flex items-center gap-4" style="--c:var(--color-accent-deep)">
          <span class="icono">.NET</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">.NET · C#</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              {api.map((t) => <li class="chip">{t}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fila">
        <span class="hidden sm:block"></span>
        <p class="conector" style="--c:var(--color-accent-soft)">EF Core</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fila">
        <p class="etiqueta">Datos</p>
        <div class="tarjeta flex items-center gap-4" style="--c:var(--color-accent-soft)">
          <span class="icono" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              class="size-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="7" ry="3"></ellipse>
              <path d="M5 5v14c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3V5"></path>
              <path d="M5 12c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">SQL Server</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              {datos.map((t) => <li class="chip">{t}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fila mt-2">
        <p class="etiqueta">Tools</p>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {
            tools.map((t) => (
              <li class="rounded-pill border border-border px-4 py-1.5 text-ink-muted">
                {t}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .monograma {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 5.5rem;
    height: 5.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--color-bg), var(--color-bg)) padding-box,
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent), var(--color-pop)) border-box;
    border: 3px solid transparent;
  }

  .text-gradient-pop {
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--color-accent) 0%,
      var(--color-pop) 100%
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .fila {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .fila {
      grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .etiqueta {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .tarjeta {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 60%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 32px color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 16%, transparent);
  }

  .icono {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    background: linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      var(--c),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 70%, var(--color-bg))
    );
  }

  .chip {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 18%, transparent);
  }

  .conector {
    justify-self: start;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--c);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }
</style>
